examples.question_text:
A rectangular box has a base measuring $6\text{ cm}$ by $8\text{ cm}$ and a height of $5\text{ cm}$. Find the longest straight rod that fits inside the box, from one corner to the opposite corner. Give its exact length and its length rounded to $2$ decimal places.

[tikz]
